<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>ORE - Omiros - 220,000 tonnes ore Ponta da Madeira/Rotterdam 25-30/11 $5.20 fio seven days shinc Rohstoffhandel.</p>
<p>Korea Line TBN - 143,000 tonnes wheat Nouadhibou plus Saldanha/South Korea 17-31/12 $8.08 fio seven days shinc Posco.</p>
<p>Agios Ioannis Theologos - 100,000 tonnrs Port Cartier/Hansaport 20-30/11 $6.25 fio five days shinc Krupp.</p>
</text>
